# Owned disposable VM only; intentionally open sender and backend controls.
pass out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from 127.0.0.1 to 127.0.0.1 port 18084 flags S/SA keep state label "aegvium-sender-open"
pass out quick on lo0 inet proto tcp from 127.0.0.1 to 127.0.0.1 port 18086:18087 flags S/SA keep state label "aegvium-backend-open"
pass all no state
